  data: {
    LLM: "1. Starting: The player to the dealer's left (or the holder of the 7 of Diamonds in some variants) begins.\n2. Valid Plays: You can only play a card if it is:\n   nd A Seven (starts a new row for a suit).\n   nd One higher or one lower than a card already in the layout (e.g., if the 7 of Hearts is on the table, you can play the 6 or 8 of Hearts).\n3. Sequencing: Suits build up from 7 to Ace and down from 7 to 2.\n4. Passing: If you cannot play a valid card, you MUST pass. In some groups, you must pay a fine (one chip) into a pot.",
    Player: "1. Starting: The player to the dealer's left (or the holder of the 7 of Diamonds in some variants) begins.\n2. Valid Plays: You can only play a card if it is:\n   nd A Seven (starts a new row for a suit).\n   nd One higher or one lower than a card already in the layout (e.g., if the 7 of Hearts is on the table, you can play the 6 or 8 of Hearts).\n3. Sequencing: Suits build up from 7 to Ace and down from 7 to 2.\n4. Passing: If you cannot play a valid card, you MUST pass. In some groups, you must pay a fine (one chip) into a pot.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to shed all cards from your hand.',
    gameplay: "1. Starting: The player to the dealer's left (or the holder of the 7 of Diamonds in some variants) begins.\n2. Valid Plays: You can only play a card if it is:\n   nd A Seven (starts a new row for a suit).\n   nd One higher or one lower than a card already in the layout (e.g., if the 7 of Hearts is on the table, you can play the 6 or 8 of Hearts).\n3. Sequencing: Suits build up from 7 to Ace and down from 7 to 2.\n4. Passing: If you cannot play a valid card, you MUST pass. In some groups, you must pay a fine (one chip) into a pot.",
    keyRules: [
      'No skipping: You cannot play an 8 unless the 7 of that suit is present.',
      'Must play: If you have a legal move, you cannot pass.',
      'Table Layout: Cards are arranged in four rows, one for each suit.',
